#. Short description.
#, gp-priority: high
msgid ""
"Modular WordPress toolbox consolidating micro-plugins into one. Each module "
"toggles independently; disabled modules add zero overhead."
msgstr "模块化 WordPress 工具箱，将多个微型插件整合为一个。各模块可独立开关；已禁用的模块不产生任何额外开销。"

#. Plugin name.
#, gp-priority: high
msgid "Dreamanual Toolkit"
msgstr "Dreamanual Toolkit"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid ""
"Site Optimize - 16 site optimization toggles, Chinese typography, admin ad "
"blocker, plus Speculative Loading"
msgstr "站点优化——16 项站点优化开关、中文排版、后台广告拦截，以及 Speculative Loading"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid ""
"Site Enhance - back-to-top button, maintenance mode, featured image filters,"
" default featured image, quick-edit excerpt, comment avatar optimization, "
"SMTP mail"
msgstr "站点增强——返回顶部按钮、维护模式、特色图片筛选、默认特色图片、快速编辑摘要、评论头像优化、SMTP 邮件"

#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid ""
"Yes. API keys and SMTP passwords are encrypted with AES-256-CBC using a key "
"derived from your wp-config.php AUTH_KEY and SECURE_AUTH_KEY."
msgstr ""
"安全。API 密钥和 SMTP 密码使用由 wp-config.php 中的 AUTH_KEY 和 SECURE_AUTH_KEY 派生的密钥进行 "
"AES-256-CBC 加密。"

#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid ""
"No. Disabled modules load no code and register no hooks, so there is zero "
"overhead from unused features."
msgstr "不会。被禁用的模块不加载任何代码、不注册任何钩子，因此未使用的功能不会带来任何额外开销。"

#. Found in faq header.
msgid "Are API keys stored securely?"
msgstr "API 密钥存储安全吗？"

#. Found in faq header.
msgid "Does this plugin slow down my site?"
msgstr "这个插件会让我的站点变慢吗？"

#. Found in installation list item.
msgid "Go to DM Toolkit - Module Management and enable the modules you need"
msgstr "进入「DM Toolkit - 模块管理」，启用你需要的模块"

#. Found in installation list item.
msgid "Activate Dreamanual Toolkit on the Plugins page"
msgstr "在「插件」页面启用 Dreamanual Toolkit"

#. Found in installation list item.
msgid "Upload the dreamanual-toolkit folder to /wp-content/plugins/"
msgstr "将 dreamanual-toolkit 文件夹上传到 /wp-content/plugins/"

