#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid ""
"Submits post URLs to search engine indexing APIs when a post is published or"
" updated. Requires site-specific API tokens configured by the site admin. No"
" data is sent unless the module is enabled and tokens are provided."
msgstr ""
"当文章发布或更新时，将文章 URL 提交到搜索引擎收录接口。需要站点管理员配置站点专属的 API "
"令牌。除非模块已启用并提供了令牌，否则不会发送任何数据。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid ""
"Connects to your own SMTP server to send emails. SMTP host, port, "
"credentials, and encryption are fully configured by the site admin. The "
"plugin does not collect or send any data to third parties; all email is "
"routed through the admin's own mail server."
msgstr ""
"连接你自己的 SMTP 服务器来发送邮件。SMTP "
"主机、端口、凭据和加密方式均由站点管理员完全配置。本插件不会向第三方收集或发送任何数据；所有邮件均通过管理员自己的邮件服务器转发。"

