msgid "Supported providers:"
msgstr "支持的提供商："

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid ""
"Sends post content (post title and body text) to your configured AI "
"provider's API for tag and excerpt generation. Data is sent only when the "
"admin clicks \"Generate\" or runs batch processing, and only if the module "
"is enabled and an API key is provided."
msgstr ""
"将文章内容（标题和正文）发送到你配置的 AI 服务商 "
"API，用于生成标签和摘要。数据仅在管理员点击「生成」或运行批量处理时发送，且仅在模块已启用并提供了 API 密钥的情况下发送。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid ""
"This plugin optionally connects to third-party services when the "
"corresponding modules are enabled. All connections are initiated by the site"
" admin and require explicitly configured credentials."
msgstr "当相应模块启用时，本插件可选择性地连接到第三方服务。所有连接均由站点管理员发起，并需要显式配置的凭据。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "Security features:"
msgstr "安全特性："

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "Modules included:"
msgstr "包含以下模块："

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid ""
"Dreamanual Toolkit gathers small single-purpose WordPress features - back-"
"to-top button, maintenance mode, featured image tools, SMTP mail, content "
"visibility, AI tag generation and more - into standalone modules under one "
"plugin. Each module can be enabled or disabled independently; disabled "
"modules load no code and register no hooks, so there is zero overhead."
msgstr ""
"Dreamanual Toolkit 将一系列单一用途的 WordPress 小功能——返回顶部按钮、维护模式、特色图片工具、SMTP "
"邮件、内容可见性、AI 标签生成等——整合到一个插件下的独立模块中。每个模块可独立启用或禁用；被禁用的模块不加载任何代码、不注册任何钩子，因此零开销。"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Front-end uses Vanilla JS with CSS BEM naming"
msgstr "前端使用原生 JS，并采用 CSS BEM 命名规范"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid ""
"Every AJAX endpoint uses check_ajax_referer + current_user_can double "
"verification"
msgstr "每个 AJAX 接口均使用 check_ajax_referer + current_user_can 双重校验"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid ""
"API keys and SMTP passwords are AES-256-CBC encrypted with a key derived "
"from AUTH_KEY + SECURE_AUTH_KEY"
msgstr "API 密钥与 SMTP 密码使用由 AUTH_KEY + SECURE_AUTH_KEY 派生的密钥进行 AES-256-CBC 加密"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid ""
"Search Push - auto-submits post links to Baidu and Bing on publish/update"
msgstr "搜索推送——发布/更新时自动将文章链接提交给百度和必应"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Role Manager - fine-grained WordPress role and capability editing"
msgstr "角色管理器——精细化的 WordPress 角色与权限编辑"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid ""
"Content Visibility - per-category content visibility with per-channel hiding"
" and role bypass"
msgstr "内容可见性——按分类控制内容可见性，支持按频道隐藏和角色豁免"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid ""
"AI Optimizer - AI-powered tag generation with batch processing and multiple "
"AI model support"
msgstr "AI 优化器——基于 AI 的标签生成，支持批量处理和多种 AI 模型"

