#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Added Terms of Service and Privacy Policy links for all external services"
msgstr "为所有外部服务新增服务条款与隐私政策链接"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Replaced inline styles/scripts with proper wp_enqueue calls"
msgstr "用规范的 wp_enqueue 调用取代内联样式/脚本"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fixed update_option return value check in AI Optimizer module"
msgstr "修复 AI 优化器模块中 update_option 返回值检查"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fixed invalid Terms of Service and Privacy Policy URLs in readme"
msgstr "修复 readme 中无效的服务条款与隐私政策链接"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Security: fixed IDOR vulnerability in AI Optimizer (missing post-level "
"capability check)"
msgstr "安全：修复 AI 优化器中的 IDOR 漏洞（缺少文章级权限检查）"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Security: fixed administrator lockout in Role Manager (protected roles can "
"no longer strip manage_options)"
msgstr "安全：修复角色管理器中管理员被锁定的问题（受保护角色不能再移除 manage_options 权限）"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Security: API key no longer exposed to frontend in batch processing"
msgstr "安全：批量处理中 API 密钥不再暴露给前端"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Fixed: Kimi model list updated to "
"kimi-k2.6/k2.7-code/k2.7-code-highspeed/k3 (moonshot-v1 series deprecated)"
msgstr ""
"修复：Kimi 模型列表更新为 kimi-k2.6/k2.7-code/k2.7-code-highspeed/k3（moonshot-v1"
" 系列已弃用）"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Fixed: Maintenance mode hardcoded lang attribute now uses "
"get_bloginfo('language')"
msgstr "修复：维护模式硬编码的 lang 属性改用 get_bloginfo('language')"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Fixed: Chinese typography now filters the_content/the_excerpt instead of "
"full-page output buffer"
msgstr "修复：中文排版改用 the_content/the_excerpt 过滤，替代全页输出缓冲"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Fixed: module deactivate now properly unregisters hooks (prevents zombie "
"state on re-activate)"
msgstr "修复：模块停用时正确注销钩子（防止重新启用时出现僵尸状态）"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Added: independent Crypto class with Error_Translator for shared network "
"error translation"
msgstr "新增：独立 Crypto 类配合 Error_Translator 实现共享网络错误翻译"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Added: support for custom post types in AI Optimizer batch processing"
msgstr "新增：AI 优化器批量处理支持自定义文章类型"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Improved: asset versioning with filemtime fallback to plugin version"
msgstr "改进：静态资源版本号使用 filemtime，回退到插件版本"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Improved: role user count uses count_users() instead of per-role queries"
msgstr "改进：角色用户数改用 count_users() 替代逐角色查询"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Improved: Baidu push URL upgraded to HTTPS"
msgstr "改进：百度推送 URL 升级为 HTTPS"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Improved: Site Optimize on_activate simplified (defaults via get_option "
"fallback)"
msgstr "改进：Site Optimize on_activate 简化（通过 get_option 回退默认值）"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fixed: PHP 8.3 fatal error on activation - Module_Base::remove() callable type hint relaxed to accept string function names"
msgstr "修复：PHP 8.3 环境启用插件时的致命错误——放宽 Module_Base::remove() 的 callable 类型声明，改为接受字符串形式的函数名"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fixed: AI Optimizer meta box no longer forces a page reload after applying changes (reload was blocked by the editor beforeunload guard, leaving the Apply button stuck; also risked losing unsaved content). Applied tags/slug/excerpt are now merged into the block editor state instead."
msgstr "修复：AI 优化器元框在应用更改后不再强制刷新页面（刷新会被编辑器的 beforeunload 拦截，导致「应用」按钮卡死，且存在丢失未保存内容的风险）。已应用的标签/别名/摘要现改为合并进区块编辑器状态。"
